TEXT 248 128 Left 2 ;Through the isolator with R=1e5 the voltage\nin the highohmic seperated part (switch with Roff=1e9)\nafter switching of is now without spikes\nTry also without isolator elements\nIsolator elements with R about 1e5 or 1e6 helps to\ndetermine a specific voltage !!!
